---
import ResourceLayout from '../../layouts/ResourceLayout.astro';
---

<ResourceLayout
  title="Hermes Shipping Provider Installation Guide | Fulcrum Agentics"
  description="Installation guide for connecting the Hermes Shipping Provider to BigCommerce."
>
  <section class="site-shell resource-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Hermes Shipping Provider</p>
    <h1>Installation Guide</h1>
    <p>
      Connect Hermes to BigCommerce checkout shipping zones after BigCommerce
      issues the shipping carrier ID for the provider app.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="site-shell resource-body">
    <h2>Provider URLs</h2>
    <dl>
      <dt>Quote URL</dt>
      <dd><code>https://hermes.fulcrumagentics.com/rate</code></dd>
      <dt>Check Connection Options URL</dt>
      <dd><code>https://hermes.fulcrumagentics.com/check_connection_options</code></dd>
    </dl>

    <h2>Connection Option</h2>
    <p>
      Hermes expects an <code>api_token</code> connection option. The value
      should match the provider token configured in the Hermes production
      environment.
    </p>

    <h2>BigCommerce Setup</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Create the Hermes Shipping Provider app in the BigCommerce Developer Portal.</li>
      <li>Send the app name, quote URL, check-connection URL, and connection option to BigCommerce shipping provider support.</li>
      <li>Wait for BigCommerce to issue the provider shipping carrier ID.</li>
      <li>Connect the carrier to the store using the issued carrier ID and the Hermes <code>api_token</code>.</li>
      <li>Add the Hermes method to the target shipping zone.</li>
      <li>Test checkout with a known case-pack product before enabling broad traffic.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Product Data Required</h2>
    <p>
      Products should carry accurate case-pack quantity, package weight, and
      package dimensions. Hermes uses that data so checkout can sell units while
      rating the correct physical case count.
    </p>

    <h2>Support</h2>
    <p>
      For setup help, contact
      <a href="mailto:hello@fulcrumagentics.com">hello@fulcrumagentics.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</ResourceLayout>
